WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
I go there once in a while, but Huaijin goes there often

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,100
Although he is not good at playing chess, he often goes along to join in the fun.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,800
That time when the accident happened, my uncle was gone

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,400
I don't know that

5
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,700
When the accident happened, they were in a mess and were carried back.

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,600
How can I even bother asking these questions?

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,000
Why is it okay to suddenly ask about this?

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,100
Just a casual question, Dafang and Sanfang seem to be in harmony

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,600
Shen Yan will never target Shen Yan for no reason.

10
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:28,530
Combined with the fact that Shen Huaijin is now announcing various alliances to replace Shen Yan’s position

11
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:29,930
Shen Yan pendant code

12
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:32,030
It definitely has something to do with Shen Huaijin

13
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:33,430
Thanks to you

14
00:00:33,430 --> 00:00:37,330
If it weren't for you, I would probably have been so decadent and closed off for the rest of my life.

15
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:40,430
That kid doesn't say anything, but I can tell he cares about you.

16
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,330
Don't worry, mother, I know everything

17
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:44,230
My husband is very good at taking me, I am not wronged

18
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,530
You have nothing to do these two days

19
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:48,330
There is no need to go to Songhe Hall to say hello to the old lady.

20
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:51,330
There was an error in the announcement in the past two days, which implicated your brother-in-law

21
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:52,830
The old lady always protected him
